### ============================================================
### M1 用户认证与授权模块
### ============================================================

### M1.1 用户注册
POST http://localhost:8080/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser01",

  "phone": "13800138001",
  "email": "test01@example.com",
  "password": "Test@123456"
}

### M1.1 用户登录（用户名/手机号/邮箱 + 密码）
POST http://localhost:8080/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "account": "testuser01",
  "password": "Test@123456"
}

### M1.1 用户登出
POST http://localhost:8080/logout
Content-Type: application/json

### M1.2 微信登录（预留）
POST http://localhost:8080/login/wechat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "wx_auth_code_placeholder"
}

### M1.3 查看用户信息
GET http://localhost:8080/users/1
Content-Type: application/json

### M1.3 修改手机号
PUT http://localhost:8080/user/phone
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "phone": "13900139001"
}

### M1.3 修改邮箱
PUT http://localhost:8080/user/email
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "email": "newemail@example.com"
}

### M1.4 校园实名认证
POST http://localhost:8080/auth
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "realName": "张三",
  "studentId": "2021001001",
  "school": "某某大学",
  "college": "计算机学院",
  "className": "软件工程2101班"
}

### M1.5 查询用户余额
GET http://localhost:8080/user/balance
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ============================================================
### M2 任务发布与接单撮合模块
### ============================================================

### M2.1 任务列表（可按类型、分类、关键词、分页查询）
GET http://localhost:8080/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

### M2.2 查看任务详情
GET http://localhost:8080/tasks/1
Content-Type: application/json

### M2.3 发布需求任务
POST http://localhost:8080/tasks
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "帮我取个快递",
  "category": "快递代取",
  "description": "在菜鸟驿站，中通快递，取件码1234，小件",
  "reward": "5元",
  "rewardValue": 5.00,
  "deadline": "2026-06-01T18:00:00",
  "contact": "微信联系",
  "images": ["https://example.com/img1.jpg"]
}

### M2.4 接取任务（Idempotency-Key 防重复提交）
POST http://localhost:8080/tasks/1/take
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

### M2.5 我接取的任务
GET http://localhost:8080/tasks/my-taken
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### M2.5 我发布的任务
GET http://localhost:8080/tasks/my-published
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### M2.6 任务完成确认（双方确认后系统释放资金）
POST http://localhost:8080/tasks/1/complete
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ============================================================
### M3 服务与交易服务模块
### ============================================================

### M3.1 发布服务单（存储在tasks表，type=service）
POST http://localhost:8080/services
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "代写Python作业",
  "category": "学习辅导",
  "description": "Python数据分析大作业，需要爬虫+可视化，价格面议",
  "reward": "面议",
  "rewardValue": 50.00,
  "deadline": "2026-06-10T23:59:59",
  "contact": "站内联系",
  "images": []
}

### M3.2 创建服务订单
POST http://localhost:8080/service-orders
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "serviceId": 1,
  "chatId": 1,
  "price": 50.00,
  "message": "我想预约这个服务"
}

### M3.3 服务订单确认
POST http://localhost:8080/service-orders/1/confirm
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### M3.4 查询某会话下的活跃订单
GET http://localhost:8080/service-orders/active?chatId=1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### M3.5 查询某会话下的历史服务订单
GET http://localhost:8080/service-orders?chatId=1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### M3.5 查询我的服务订单
GET http://localhost:8080/service-orders/my
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ============================================================
### M4 聊天消息与通信模块
### ============================================================

### M4.1 会话列表（按最后消息时间倒序）
GET http://localhost:8080/conversations
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### M4.2 消息记录
GET http://localhost:8080/conversations/1/messages
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### M4.3 发送消息
POST http://localhost:8080/conversations/1/messages
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "content": "你好，我想了解一下这个任务"
}

### M4.4 撤回消息
POST http://localhost:8080/messages/1/withdraw
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### M4.5 确认或创建会话（根据partnerId和taskId）
POST http://localhost:8080/conversations/ensure
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "partnerId": 2,
  "taskId": 1
}


### ============================================================
### M6 评价与信誉管理模块
### ============================================================

### M6.1 提交评价（任务完成后对对方评分）
POST http://localhost:8080/reviews
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "taskId": 1,
  "revieweeId": 2,
  "rating": 5,
  "content": "非常靠谱，准时完成任务！"
}

### M6.3 查看用户收到的评价
GET http://localhost:8080/reviews?userId=2
Content-Type: application/json
